#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""FS3 v166 - keener small craft, fixes to M62-M66.

    Fighters  (enemy and allied alike, Silvio: more aggressive) the run in
              aims straight at the target and only the last stretch slides
              beside it; fighters break off after 0.3 s instead of 0.95 s
              and turn straight back; turns build faster; a little quicker
              and tighter (2.4 / 0.066, bombers 1.6 / 0.038); shorter
              evasion; guns bear within 0.50 rad instead of 0.42.
    M62       more Shivan fighters (two wings, six at a time).
    M63       the Charybdis has half a cruiser's hull, and jumps on once the
              job is done (she could die after the success card).
    Allies    our own ships no longer show subsystem marks.
    M65       buoys drawn at two thirds of their size, and they stay until
              the screen goes dark instead of vanishing.
    M66       the freighters fly in from the left edge instead of popping
              up in the middle of the field.

Needs v165. Edits src/30_waves.js, src/40_world.js, src/50_combat.js and
src/70_ui.js in place, and writes the updated fieldsim.js and ramsim.js.
Run assemble.py afterwards.
"""
